BIOSTATEER™ ENTERPRISE CLINICAL & BIOSTATISTICS INTELLECTUAL PLATFORM
====================================================================
VERSION 1.2 USER MANUAL EXPORT ARTIFACT (PDF FORMAT)
====================================================================

The comprehensive Biostateer™ User Manual v1.2 is fully drafted and maintained in the standard markdown source file:
- File Location: /docs/Biostateer_User_Manual_v1.2.md

To compile this markdown file into a formatted Adobe PDF document, system administrators or biostatisticians can utilize standard document compilers:

1. COMPILATION VIA PANDOC (Recommended)
   Run the following terminal commands to export formatted documents:
   
   # For PDF Export (Requires LaTeX):
   pandoc docs/Biostateer_User_Manual_v1.2.md -o docs/Biostateer_User_Manual_v1.2.pdf --pdf-engine=xelatex

2. COMPILATION VIA MICROSOFT WORD
   Open Microsoft Word, select "Open", and open the markdown source file directly. Word will automatically parse the layout, styling, and equations. Click "Save As" and choose PDF format.

